xeondesktop (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows 7's taskbar: window thumbnails with Aero Peek, jump lists with
    pinning, buttons combined as needed; Aero's Window Color and Appearance.
  * XP Start menu: pinning from All Programs, new-program highlights, icon
    size; Quick Launch view options; a tall taskbar's clock shows the date.
  * Screen savers: per-saver Settings, 3D Pipes and 3D Text.
  * The Language bar's indicator on the taskbar, with its layout menu.
  * Several monitors: desktop icons on the primary one, the lock dialog
    where the pointer is, window menus without a taskbar.
  * Explorer: Thumbnails view (decoded in a sandbox), Favorites, Search,
    groups in Details view, a Shortcut tab and drive pie charts.
  * Task Manager's Networking and Users tabs; Power Options' Alarms and
    Power Meter; Accessibility's Sound tab; Add or Remove Programs shows
    each program's source and Last Used On.
  * The taskbar can run alone under other wlroots compositors.
  * Hung programs that draw their own title bar get a frame to close them;
    the compositor runs at raised priority, as other desktops' do.
  * GTK programs: list-box drop-downs, framed message boxes, appearance
    changes followed live, no blue frame around menus.
  * Packages for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS, with wlroots 0.20 built in.

 -- xeon <xeon.productions@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:03:55 -0500

xeondesktop (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Aero (Windows 7) style with blurred glass on a GPU, Aero Snap, Peek and
    Shake, and Windows 7's icon taskbar with pinned programs and jump lists.
  * Luna colour schemes measured from Windows XP: Silver, Olive Green and
    Energy Blue; all 22 classic colour schemes with checked colours.
  * Control Panel: every applet, Administrative Tools (Services, Event
    Viewer, Disk Management) and Scheduled Tasks.
  * Start menus: Search, Help and Support, Default Programs, Switch User,
    keyboard use; desktop icons with Customize Desktop and Auto Arrange.
  * Explorer: file operations, Details columns, Send To, Undo, Recycle Bin.
  * Sound scheme events, accessibility keys, title bar icons, icon theme,
    GTK theme and Qt style settings; Qt programs follow the desktop's look.
  * Session: systemd graphical-session.target, XDG autostart, VirtualBox's
    shared clipboard; software rendering on virtual machine GPUs.
  * Many fixes from a bug hunt, a headless UI test suite, and zero-warning
    GCC and Clang builds, debug and optimized.

 -- xeon <xeon.productions@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:15:43 +0000

